<title>POLAND: ANIMEX APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>ANIMEX APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.72 vs   2.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.48 vs   2.23</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.43 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Sales		   49.43 vs  34.03</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.90 vs   5.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.27 vs   6.74</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.21 vs   4.59</p>
<p> Sales		  176.91 vs 142.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Animex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
